---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Industries | EVO"
  description="EVO engineering and automation solutions for production, buildings, technical spaces and connected environments."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">INDUSTRIES</p>
        <h1>Different environments. <span>One engineering mindset.</span></h1>
        <p>EVO works where control, machinery, connected systems and smarter environments need to operate reliably in the real world.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Discuss Your Site ↗</a><a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/projects">View Projects</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/hero/evo-hero-spatial.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHERE WE WORK</p><h2>Solutions shaped around <span>the environment.</span></h2></div><p>The same technology behaves differently in a production line, a home, a warehouse or a technical facility. EVO designs around that reality.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid-4">
        <article class="industry-tile"><div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">01</span><h3>Manufacturing &amp; Production</h3><p>Machine control, production improvements, automated handling and process integration.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/industrial-automation">↗</a></div><div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-industrial-automation.png" alt="Industrial automation" /></div></article>
        <article class="industry-tile"><div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">02</span><h3>Homes &amp; Residences</h3><p>Lighting, climate, access, audio, scenes and connected smart living experiences.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/smart-living">↗</a></div><div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-smart-living.png" alt="Smart living" /></div></article>
        <article class="industry-tile"><div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">03</span><h3>Buildings &amp; Technical Spaces</h3><p>Integrated control, monitoring and automation for shared infrastructure and facilities.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/systems-integrations">↗</a></div><div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-systems-integrations.png" alt="Connected systems" /></div></article>
        <article class="industry-tile"><div class="tile-copy"><span class="tile-number">04</span><h3>Special Engineering Applications</h3><p>Custom machinery, modifications, prototypes and systems that do not fit a standard catalogue.</p><a class="tile-link" href="/solutions/custom-engineering">↗</a></div><div class="tile-visual"><img src="/solutions/solution-custom-engineering.png" alt="Custom engineering" /></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE COMMON THREAD</p><h2>Practical systems. <span>Clear operation.</span></h2></div><p>Whatever the sector, EVO prioritizes maintainability, understandable control and engineering that fits the people who actually use the system.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid-3">
        <article class="content-card"><span>01</span><h3>Operational Fit</h3><p>Technology is selected around the actual workflow, site constraints and users.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>02</span><h3>Integrated Decisions</h3><p>Mechanical, electrical, control and software choices are considered together.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>03</span><h3>Room to Grow</h3><p>Solutions can start focused and expand as requirements, sites or services evolve.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
